  "title": "Second Nature",
  "description": "The Foundry VTT game system for Second Nature, a tabletop roleplaying game by Richard Moore: kids who can become animals take on the Gilded Hunt. Character sheets with both forms, a roll dialog that applies every Strength, Weakness, perk and the Cap, roll cards with Push and the animal perks, and a Mission Tracker that runs Scent, obstacles, Clashes, the Hunt and the campaign for you. Includes the six ready-made Bonded, the threats, the five missions and the rules.",
